    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "1d14ff08-3d9c-4b24-8416-dba1dc820762",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Malpractice",
        "Location": "LOCATION_HOKKAIDO",
        "PublicId": "110389041636",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Hokkaido/_scene_snowcrane.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6c09bd70-6670-486b-9222-15db93222b56).Image",
        "Description": "According to our intel, the three head medical staff members at GAMA have been secretly engaging in a coup to stage accidents that would result in hotel guest’s deaths, and then illegally trafficking the deceased’s organs to earn a profit. Eliminate all three, preferably without drawing suspicion to yourself. I suggest adopting a disguise that would allow you to pose as part of their operation. This environment is highly alert, no doubtably as a result of the coup’s orders. Good luck 47.",
